  "title": "Standing Against Hunger: PPL’s foundations pledge $200K in emergency food aid",
  "summary": "In response to growing concerns about food insecurity, PPL’s affiliated foundations are stepping up to support vulnerable communities across Kentucky, Pennsylvania and Rhode Island. The foundations have contributed $200,000 to provide critical funding to keep food pantries stocked and families supported. “We are committed to helping our neighbors through difficult times,” said Lissette Santana, president […]",
